license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "Fully autonomous agentic research. For a normalized Rademacher sum X with all coefficients at most a in absolute value, 0 < a <= 0.07, P(|X| <= x) <= 2 Phi(x) + 2 Phi(a) - 2 for every x >= 0. This closes the range left open by Ivanisvili's computer-assisted results, so the Keller-Klein conjecture follows conditionally on those results. Lean proofs are included. Dev D. Goyal is responsible for publication. No expert validation or peer review is claimed."
keywords:
  - "Keller-Klein conjecture"
